   "source": [
    "**Delete Duplicate Emails Keeping One**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2b609442",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```sql\n",
    "SELECT id, email\n",
    "FROM (\n",
    "    SELECT id, email,\n",
    "           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY email ORDER BY id) AS rn\n",
    "    FROM person\n",
    ") t\n",
    "WHERE rn = 1\n",
    "ORDER BY id;\n",
    "```"
   ]
  }
